WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.397
Every file in your folder gets one of
three verdicts.

2
00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:10.822
Most pictures are simply sent, with no
badge, because the picture is a true copy.

3
00:00:11.392 --> 00:00:16.646
A Photoshop file saved without a full
preview is converted and sent,

4
00:00:16.646 --> 00:00:18.423
but marked approximate.

5
00:00:18.993 --> 00:00:23.046
An InDesign file cannot be read, so it is
not sent,

6
00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:25.907
and its row tells you how to fix it.
